5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let's get started! I want to see who we can actually hire and who's available to help our companies.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,I'm interested in the actual performance of our current holdings. I'll look into the retention and the exits.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'll be the one to check our financial flexibility. I want to know about the reserves and the credit line.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know why the end of the quarter is so stressful! I'll check the audit needs and the independent checks.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'm concerned about deployment delays. I'll look into the security review times and the delivery records.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, do you think the recruiter data will help us avoid the staffing bottlenecks we've had?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,George,,Perhaps. I'll stick to my plan for now.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, you always spot the bottlenecks. Let's see if our findings overlap.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I hope I find a way to make the reporting easier for everyone!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree, May. Understanding the gap between funding and deployment is critical for our next choice.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll also check the adviser bench to see if we have any untapped expertise.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
