35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"It looks like we're great at finding software support, but terrible at finding operational staff. Also, our software partners are totally overloaded!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,George,,"Interesting. It seems our most stable returns come from back-office tools, and those with physical assets are riskier regarding retention and losses.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"We have a problem. Our reserves are being drained by hardware-heavy companies way faster than planned, and our credit line is useless for software.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"I found it! Hardware and depots make our audits a nightmare and cost a fortune, but they are the only ones we can actually verify independently!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I've found a pattern. Medical and financial data cause massive security delays, and custom hardware leads to unpredictable delivery failures.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@May, if the credit line doesn't help software, does that mean we should avoid more software companies?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,George,,"@Mizuki, so hardware is slow to deliver, but @Rin says it's easier to verify. That's a difficult trade-off.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"Exactly, Mio. We're bleeding cash on hardware, but the bank won't lend against software subscriptions. We're stuck between a rock and a hard place.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"But if we pick software, we just have to trust their dashboards! That's what makes the quarter-end so scary.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"We need to avoid the ""three-quarter"" security wait. That means avoiding medical records or financial intermediaries if we want speed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"If we go with something operational, we have the advisers to help, but we can't find the staff to run it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,George,,The data shows the write-off was a company with its own premises and hourly crews. That's a warning.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,And the follow-on calls for equipment are killing our liquidity. I'm leaning away from anything with a warehouse.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I just want the audit to be fast! No depots, no installed hardware. Please!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"So we want something that isn't medical, isn't financial, and doesn't require a warehouse or custom hardware.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,That doesn't leave much! But at least we know our software partners are too busy to take more board seats.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,George,,We need a balance of stability and sanity.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,Let's see the candidates and decide who fits this narrow window.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,Yay! Let's see them!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Let's move to the final selection.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
