60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Fabric Loop needs shift supervisors—we can't hire those! And our software partners are full, so Ledger Bridge or Clinic Scheduler would be a burden.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,George,,"Fabric Loop has premises and crews; that's exactly like our write-off. Harvest Sensor has good retention, but it's hardware.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"Fabric Loop and Harvest Sensor will drain our reserves and the credit line won't help. Ledger Bridge is software, but it's financial.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,Fabric Loop and Harvest Sensor mean expensive audits and long waits! I hate them! Ledger Bridge is just a dashboard!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,Clinic Scheduler has medical records—that's a nine-month delay. Ledger Bridge has financial records—also a nine-month delay.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"Wait, if Ledger Bridge is just software, can't we use the recruiters for the rollout? That's the only part we're fast at.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,George,,"Ledger Bridge is ""back-office tooling for financial operations."" That's exactly what our most profitable exits were.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,But the credit line treats those subscriptions as zero security. We'll have to fund it entirely from the dwindling reserves.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,But it's a dashboard! No outside appraisals! No six-week audit delays! I love it!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,It's a choice between a long security review for Ledger Bridge or the operational chaos of Fabric Loop and Harvest Sensor.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I'll vote for Ledger Bridge. Even if the partners are busy, it's better than not being able to hire anyone at all.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,George,,"I agree. The exit profile for financial back-office tools is too strong to ignore, despite the reporting issues.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"I'm worried about the cash, but Fabric Loop is a liquidity nightmare. Ledger Bridge is the safest bet for the fund's survival.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,Ledger Bridge! Ledger Bridge! No more expensive auditors!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,It's the most logical choice. We accept the security review delay to avoid the hardware delivery and staffing failures.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
